      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A standard CI/CD pipeline progresses through stages like **Build**, **Test**, **Staging/QA**, and finally **Production**. During the Build stage, gates should include dependency scanning and successful compilation. The Test stage requires unit and integration test coverage exceeding a defined threshold, while the Staging gate needs successful end-to-end testing and manual security reviews. Finally, production deployment often involves automated canary releases or blue/green deployments as a final safety measure.",
